      "/c"
    ],
    "speed": {
      "type": "Property",
      "value": 20
    },
    "type": "Vehicle"
  }
]



07. Seed urn:V1 locally on CB too - scope /a and /d
==================================================
HTTP/1.1 201 Created


08. GET urn:V1 on CB - the local copy is a version too: [/a, /d, /b, /c]
=======================================================================
  /a is seen twice (locally and on CP1) and appears once

HTTP/1.1 200 OK
